item.description:
Take Screen Shot
take a screenshot of the canvas (automatically remove all buttons in the page for the screenshot). Image will be saved in the Camera Roll folder of the device. An alert will appear after the recording.
Parameters are:
Play shutter audio: if checked, plays an audio simulating a real camera shutter, to provide feedback to the user;
Alert title: title of the alert window;
Alert message: content of the alert window.
